Z||000000||MrPBody||03-30-2001||09:33 PM||||FieroJoe is going to Big Sky, but where do you like to ski?<P>We've been to a few places out west, North Carolina, Georgia, even Alabama.  <I>(I'm not kidding!)</I>  So far my favorite is Alta, Utah.<P>See  <A HREF="http://home.att.net/~cochran2/skiing01/menu01.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://home.att.net/~cochran2/skiing01/menu01.htm</A> <BR>||||reg||1
