Z||000002||jch82||03-31-2001||02:47 AM||||Always wanted to go to the Rockies! The best place I have been to in MI so far is Crystal Mountain....I love all the wooded trails! BTW, I use snowblades<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Yeah, my girlfriend takes collect calls from the road<BR>And it doesn't seem to matter that I'm lacking in the bulge<BR>She laughs at my dumb jokes when no one does<BR>She brings me mexican food from Sombrero's just because<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||6
