Z||000007||Songman||04-01-2001||02:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>Last year in the beginning of march I went to Vail Colorado and it was amazing.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Vail is about half an hour from Breckenridge, Lisa.. I always stay in Breckenridge and take day trips to Vail, Keystone, Copper Mountain, Aspen and a lot more... Great fun!<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
